[{"id": 55293183, "text": "<h2>You Will Need:</h2>\nTwo Battleships sheets.\n<br></br>\nPlayer 1 and Player 2 should look at their page but not show it to the other player. On your page, there are two 11x11 grids. The left-hand grid is mostly blank (with one word written in), and the right-hand grid is filled with words (and some blank spaces).", "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 1, "btnType": "PRIMARY", "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "TEXT_AND_IMAGE", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{'headers':['Col1'],'rows':[{'col1':'row1'},{'col1':'row2'}, {'col1':'row3'}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": 54225606, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [[""]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": null, "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": null, "selectedModalId": 0, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 154810388, "text": null, "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 6, "btnType": "PRIMARY", "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "EDITOR", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{'headers':['Col1'],'rows':[{'col1':'row1'},{'col1':'row2'}, {'col1':'row3'}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": 54225606, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [[""]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": "<h2>Scoring:</h2>\n<p><strong>1 point:</strong></p>\n<p>When you sink a battleship, count how many letters it has and write it in the space at the bottom of your sheet. Say your word in a sentence to get one point.</p>\n<p></p>\n<p><strong>5 bonus points:</strong></p>\n<p>The first player to fill in all the spaces at the bottom of their sheet gets five bonus points!&nbsp;</p>\n<p></p>\n<p><strong>Winner:</strong></p>\n<p>The winner is the person with the most points after both players have sunk all the ships.</p>\n<p></p>\n", "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": false, "selectedModalId": 0, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 55291214, "text": "<h2>How to Play:</h2>\nTake it in turns to choose a square on your blank grid. Say the grid reference (e.g. C6) and the other player will either say 'miss' if that square is blank on their right-hand grid or 'hit' if that square is filled on their right-hand grid. \n<ul>\n<li>If they say 'miss', colour the correct square on your left-hand grid to show it is empty.</li>\n<li>If they say 'hit', they will then tell you which letter goes in that square. Write the letter in the correct square on your left-hand grid. </li>\n</ul>\nIf you have now guessed all the letters in a word with your 'hit', then they other player will say 'sunk' after they tell you the letter.", "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 5, "btnType": "PRIMARY", "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "TEXT_AND_IMAGE", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{'headers':['Col1'],'rows':[{'col1':'row1'},{'col1':'row2'}, {'col1':'row3'}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": 54225606, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [[""]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": null, "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": null, "selectedModalId": 0, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 154809910, "text": "One battleships sheet - a hand holding a purple pen has written the word 'rebook' in the square grid, as well as in the 6-letter-word space at the bottom of the sheet. Some squares in the grid have been coloured in.", "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 4, "btnType": "PRIMARY", "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": "Battleships re sheet blob", "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": "Battleships re sheet blob-vrTuC-iJ9sclAx1EPAOWr.png", "linkName": null, "stepType": "IMAGE", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{'headers':['Col1'],'rows':[{'col1':'row1'},{'col1':'row2'}, {'col1':'row3'}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": 54225606, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [[""]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": null, "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": false, "selectedModalId": 0, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 154809964, "text": null, "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 3, "btnType": "PRIMARY", "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "EDITOR", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{'headers':['Col1'],'rows':[{'col1':'row1'},{'col1':'row2'}, {'col1':'row3'}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": 54225606, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": "", "